/২</p>"}, {"id": "25", "question": "২৫) 4 + 8 + 16 + 32 + .... ধারাটির কততম পদের মান 1024?", "option1": "ক) 8", "option2": "খ) 9", "option3": "গ) 10", "option4": "ঘ) 11", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>১ম পদ (a) = 4,<br />সাধারন অনুপাত (r) = 8/4 = 2<br />ধরি, n-তম পদ&nbsp;= 1024<br />বা, a.r<sup>n - 1 </sup>= 1024<br />বা, 4.2<sup>n - 1</sup> = 2<sup>10</sup><br />বা, 2<sup>2</sup>.2<sup>n - 1</sup>&nbsp;= 2<sup>10</sup><br />বা, 2<sup>n + 1</sup> = 2<sup>10</sup><br />বা, n + 1 = 10<br />&there4; n = 9</p>"}, {"id": "26", "question": "২৬) 4, 8, 16 .... ধারাটির n পদের সমষ্টি 252 হলে, n = ?", "option1": "ক) 4", "option2": "খ) 5", "option3": "গ) 6", "option4": "ঘ) 7", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>a = 4,<br />r = 8/4 = 2<br />&there4; সমষ্টি = a.{(r<sup>n</sup> - 1)/(r - 1)}<br />= 4.{(2<sup>n</sup> - 1)/(2 - 1)<br />= 4(2<sup>n</sup> - 1)<br />&there4; 4(2<sup>n</sup> - 1) = 252<br />বা, 2<sup>n</sup> - 1 = 63<br />বা, 2<sup>n</sup> = 64 = 2<sup>6</sup><br />&there4; n = 6</p>"}, {"id": "27", "question": "২৭) 2 + 1 + 1/2 + 1/4 + ..... ধারাটির প্রথম আটটি পদের সমষ্টি কত?", "option1": "ক) 64/255", "option2": "খ) 255/65", "option3": "গ) 65/255", "option4": "ঘ) 255/64", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>a = 2, r = 1/2, n = 8<br />&there4; সমষ্টি = a.{(1 - r<sup>8</sup>)/(1 - r)<br />= 2.{(1 - (1/2)<sup>8</sup>}/(1 - 1/2)<br />= 2.{1 - (1/256)}/(1/2)<br />= 2 &times; 2 &times; (255/256)<br />= 255/64</p>"}, {"id": "28", "question": "২৮) 5 + a + b + 135 + .... ধারাটিতে a = ?", "option1": "ক) 15", "option2": "খ) 45", "option3": "গ) 60", "option4": "ঘ) 75", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>১ম পদ, a = 5,<br />সাধারন অনুপাত r হলে,<br />৪র্থ পদ = ar<sup>4-1</sup> = 135<br />বা, 5r<sup>3</sup> = 135<br />বা, r<sup>3</sup> = 27 = 3<sup>3</sup><br />&there4; r = 3<br />&there4; a = ২য় পদ<br />= ar<br />= 5.3<br />= 15</p>"}, {"id": "29", "question": "২৯) 1 - 1 + 1 - 1 + ... ধারাটির 2n পদের সমষ্টি কত?", "option1": "ক) -2", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>